\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, the all- restoring Word,
\par My fallen spirit's hope,
\par After Thy lovely likeness, Lord,
\par Ah, when shall I wake up?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thou, O my God, Thou only art
\par The Life, the Truth, the Way;
\par Quicken my soul, instruct my heart,
\par My sinking footsteps stay.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Of all Thou hast in earth below,
\par In heaven above, to give,
\par Give me Thy love alone to know,
\par In Thee to walk and live.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Fill me with all the life of love;
\par In mystic union join
\par Me to Thyself, and let me prove
\par The fellowship divine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Open the intercourse between
\par My longing soul and Thee,
\par Never to be broke off again
\par To all eternity.
\par              Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

